c. education;
d. manpower;
e. social;
f. mental and spiritual; andg. peace and order.
3. Prevention by regional apparatus as referred to in paragraph (2) is coordinated by the Agency. (4) Prevention of violence by regional apparatus as referred to in paragraph (2) is implemented in an integrated and continuous manner based on RAD.

