BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF BITUNG,

Considering:
a. that the guarantee of respect, protection and fulfillment of Human Rights for every Indonesian Citizen in the Region is a duty that must be carried out by the Regional Government;
b. that Bitung City as a rapidly developing industrial city as one of the economic centers in North Sulawesi Province, has created many job opportunities so that many people from various areas outside Bitung City come to work within the territory of Bitung City and potentially create social friction which can result in the vulnerability of women and children to become victims of acts of violence;
c. that in the framework of implementing regional autonomy which refers to Article 12 paragraph (2) letter b and

Article 11

